      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最近，我住的公寓\n总是发生奇怪的事情。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
